{
  "_comment": "Tournament between two candidate SKILL.md files for a hypothetical /summarize skill. v_terse is permissive (3 lines max). v_strict requires citation. v_chain is the same as v_strict plus a 'think first, then write' chain-of-thought directive. Judges score on different criteria; the tournament decides which deserves @production.",
